###> symfony/mailer ###
# Mailpit, the catcher compose.override.yaml adds to the dev stack: every message the site sends
# lands in the inbox at http://localhost:8025 instead of going out. A real sender (Mailtrap sandbox,
# for instance) goes in .env.dev.local, which is git-ignored and loads after this file.
MAILER_DSN=smtp://mailer:1025
###< symfony/mailer ###
